WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.092 --> 00:00:02.947
(ethereal music)

00:00:02.947 --> 00:00:04.731
[Narrator] Paris, without people?

00:00:04.731 --> 00:00:06.953
No, this isn't an apocalypse.

00:00:06.953 --> 00:00:08.870
This is Paris in China.

00:00:12.592 --> 00:00:15.253
Tianducheng is a luxury
real estate development

00:00:15.253 --> 00:00:19.314
and a Paris look-a-like
located in Hangzhou, China.

00:00:19.314 --> 00:00:22.009
As China became the world's
fastest growing economy,

00:00:22.009 --> 00:00:25.353
real estate developments
popped up all over the country,

00:00:25.353 --> 00:00:28.762
some modeled from famous western cities.

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:32.788
This Chinese Paris started
construction in 2007.

00:00:32.788 --> 00:00:35.594
And while the city is built
to hold 10,000 people,

00:00:35.594 --> 00:00:37.699
only 2,000 live there full time

00:00:37.699 --> 00:00:40.866
making it feel more like a ghost town.

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:44.049
The lack of people could be linked

00:00:44.049 --> 00:00:45.825
to where Tianducheng is located,

00:00:45.825 --> 00:00:49.408
surrounded by miles
and miles of farm land.

00:00:50.448 --> 00:00:52.790
The Eiffel Tower replica
is about 1/3 the size

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:55.165
of the original and stands surrounded

00:00:55.165 --> 00:00:57.748
by copycat French architecture.

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:02.738
And just like the original,

00:01:02.738 --> 00:01:04.536
it's a great backdrop for newlyweds

00:01:04.536 --> 00:01:06.721
looking for an everlasting memory.

00:01:06.721 --> 00:01:08.143
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:08.143 --> 00:01:09.537
You know what they say,

00:01:09.537 --> 00:01:13.120
imitation is the
sincerest form of flattery.

